OL,3,GNEWSAOwner told he cannot keep his
OL,4,Ashop's red shutters
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shop owner has said it is
OL,7,F"frustrating" he has been refused
OL,8,Fpermission to keep his bright red
OL,9,Fsecurity shutters despite his concerns
OL,10,Fabout crime in High Wycombe town
OL,11,Fcentre.
OL,13,FCharanjeet Kukraija, who runs One Stop
OL,14,FPhone & Vape Store on the High Street,
OL,15,Fsaid he installed the shutters to
OL,16,Fprotect his premises from break-ins and
OL,17,Fshoplifters.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
