OL,3,GNEWSAOwner told he cannot keep his
OL,4,Ashop's red shutters
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe submitted a retrospective planning
OL,7,Fapplication after receiving an
OL,8,Fenforcement notice from Buckinghamshire
OL,9,FCouncil in July ordering him to remove
OL,10,Fthem.
OL,12,FThat application has now been turned
OL,13,Fdown, and the enforcement notice
OL,14,Frequires compliance by December.
